   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 5,
   "response_text": "I can see the label_noise_fraction is being applied (lines 186-194). Let me check the actual value in config and see if this might be the issue. The config shows `label_noise_fraction: 0.33` which means 33% of the training labels are being flipped. Let me continue reading the training loop to see the rest:",
